<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON, South Africa 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard  in</p>
<p>the triangular series day/night match between South Africa and</p>
<p>India on Tuesday:</p>
<p>India</p>
<p> S.Ganguly run out			    83</p>
<p> R.Dravid run out			     53</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar c Cullinan b Klusener	14</p>
<p> M.Azharuddin b Donald			13</p>
<p> A.Jadeja c Cronje b Klusener	     19</p>
<p> R.Singh not out				32</p>
<p> S.Karim not out				 7</p>
<p> Extras (lb-7, w-3, nb-1)		   11</p>
<p> Total (five wickets)			232</p>
<p>Did not bat: S.Joshi, A.Kumble, J.Srinath, V.Prasad.</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-117 2-150 3-171 4-176 5-216</p>
<p>Bowling: Pollock 10-2-26-0 (1w), Kallis 6-0-34-0 (2w),</p>
<p>Klusener 10-0-58-2, Donald 10-1-38-1 (1nb), Cronje 9-1-37-0,</p>
<p>Adams 5-0-32-0</p>
<p>South Africa</p>
<p> A.Bacher c Dravid b Kumble		 14</p>
<p> G.Kirsten c Kumble b Prasad		82</p>
<p> D.Cullinan st Karim b Joshi		32</p>
<p> J.Kallis not out			     52</p>
<p> J.Rhodes lbw Srinath			 22</p>
<p> H.Cronje not out			     21</p>
<p> Extras (b-1 lb-7 w-2 nb-3)		 13</p>
<p> Total (for four wickets)		  236</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-44 2-134 3-142 4-200</p>
<p>Did not bat: S.Pollock, D.Richardson, L.Klusener, A.Donald,</p>
<p>P.Adams.</p>
<p>Bowling: Srinath 10-0-50-1, Prasad 9.2-1-43-1 (1w 2nb),</p>
<p>Kumble 10-0-36-1 (1w), Singh 6-0-31-0 (1nb), Joshi 10-0-48-1,</p>
<p>Tendulkar 3-0-17-0, Jadeja 1-0-3-0.</p>
<p>Result: South Africa won by six wickets</p>
